---
import Base from "@Layout/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	Title="Crates - Aphrodite"
	Description="The Aphrodite workspace: the aphrodite proxy crate and the aphrodite-hermes integration crate, both v1.6.6."
>
	<main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-1 flex-col gap-12 px-6 py-16">
		<header class="flex flex-col gap-4">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Crates</h1>
			<p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-neutral-600">
				Two workspace crates plus the vendored Headroom fork that carries the content
				transforms. Aphrodite adds the preview pipeline, CCR storage, Hermes integration,
				and dual-proxy architecture on top of Headroom.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="flex flex-col gap-6">
			<article class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-300 p-6">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
					aphrodite <span class="text-sm font-normal text-neutral-500">v1.6.6</span>
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-600">
					Chat Completions proxy with CCR, tool relay, and programmatic CCR for Hermes
					agent integration. Ships the <code class="font-mono text-sm">aphrodite</code>
					binary and a cdylib/rlib library; built on axum and tokio.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-300 p-6">
				<h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
					aphrodite-hermes <span class="text-sm font-normal text-neutral-500">v1.6.6</span>
				</h2>
				<p class="text-neutral-600">
					Hermes Agent-specific integration for the Aphrodite compression engine - tool
					schemas, hook dispatch, skill registration. Ships the
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">aphrodite-hermes-setup</code> helper binary and
					the dylib; watches config with notify.
				</p>
			</article>
		</section>

		<section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Configuration surface</h2>
			<p class="max-w-3xl text-neutral-600">
				From <code class="font-mono text-sm">aphrodite.toml.example</code> - the main
				sections:
			</p>
			<ul class="flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-3 text-neutral-600">
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[[proxies]]</code> - named listeners; the two
					defaults are <code class="font-mono text-sm">cache</code> on
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">127.0.0.1:9797</code> (timeout 120) and
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">token</code> on
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">127.0.0.1:9798</code> (timeout 300), both with
					tool relay on.
				</li>
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[defaults]</code> - <code class="font-mono text-sm">api_url</code
					>, <code class="font-mono text-sm">model</code>,
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">ccr_ttl_seconds</code> (3600), optional
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">api_key</code>.
				</li>
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[compression]</code> - the engine thresholds
					(<code class="font-mono text-sm">engine_threshold_pct</code> 45, protect-first
					2 / protect-last 5, min 8 messages), the type multipliers (code ×3), the
					context engine toggle, polling worker, opt-in auto-reload, and chain splitting.
				</li>
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[previews]</code> - preview rendering options;
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">preview_max_chars</code> 120.
				</li>
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[prompts]</code> - retrieval guidance and the
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">session_inject</code> CCR notice.
				</li>
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[directives]</code> - the active directive list
					(seeding <code class="font-mono text-sm">focus</code> and
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">foresight</code>).
				</li>
				<li>
					<code class="font-mono text-sm">[flow]</code> - <code class="font-mono text-sm"
						>budget_chars</code
					>, the hard cap for all per-turn injected context (2600).
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p class="max-w-3xl text-sm text-neutral-600">
				Keys not yet wired into the runtime are annotated DOCUMENTED BUT UNWIRED in the
				example; dead sections (<code class="font-mono text-sm">[templates.*]</code>) were
				removed in v1.6.6.
			</p>
		</section>
	</main>

	<footer class="border-t border-neutral-200 px-6 py-8 text-sm text-neutral-500">
		Aphrodite - CC0-1.0, public domain. Built by PlayForm.
	</footer>
</Base>
